{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/22863-pacting-for-fun-and-profit-aka-stupid-demon-tricks","id":22863,"title":"Pacting for Fun and Profit (aka Stupid Demon Tricks)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-03T20:42:36-08:00","id":22863,"title":"Pacting for Fun and Profit (aka Stupid Demon Tricks)","content":"Ok, so we've all read the book by this point and no doubt you've come up with a combination of powers or uses of powers that seem fun (or funny) to you. So, tell us about them!<br /> <br /> Here are mine:<br /> <br /> First a loophole: Given the way the game works, it seems like it would often be better to take three one point Cover pieces with a pact, as opposed to grabbing a three point piece. I mean, if all you want is a stronger Cover, then a souvenir of a family trip from the target's childhood, their relationship with a grade school bully, and a high school friend who they still exchange Christmas cards with, seems like a much easier sell than the target's spouse, no matter what you're offering. If you particularly want the target's spouse (or the target wants to give them up for that matter), ok, that's different, but, if you're just in it for the xp, then, yeah, three one point clauses seems like the way to go here. I'm not sure that's as intended.<br /> <br /> Next some fun: Grant someone a year long pact to make them a pop star, in exchange for whatever bits of their life you can get from them. Then, renew it each year, in exchange for their relationships with their stalkers. Once the stalkers are after you, uses your powers to induct them into your growing Cult.<br /> <br /> Given that you keep the same relationship context as the target of a pact, can you use a patch job to make the subject of a relationship homosexual? I mean, if you get a guy to give up his wife and then patch it into a female cover, is the wife now a lesbian?<br /> <br /> Once your Cover starts to get too old, get a job as a high school teacher and build a nice young patchwork cover from the local students. Everyone wants better grades, right? Maybe social or athletic ability? It might even be considered a useful service, since you're effectively making them smarter, stronger, or otherwise better and they didn't really want to have that bully after them either. I'm sure there's a nerd or two who would be quite willing to trade away their existing relationship with the head cheerleader in exchange for the looks and charm necessary to have the relationship they actually <i>want</i> with her. And the jocks who need to pass their classes to stay on the team or want an edge on the field should be ripe pickings too.<br /> <br /> What have you thought of?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T20:55:34-08:00","id":22872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/22863-pacting-for-fun-and-profit-aka-stupid-demon-tricks#post22863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given that you keep the same relationship context as the target of a pact, can you use a patch job to make the subject of a relationship homosexual? I mean, if you get a guy to give up his wife and then patch it into a female cover, is the wife now a lesbian?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, the wife is just married to a woman. Depending on her particular sexual orientation, she might be a bit put-off by it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T21:11:43-08:00","id":22881,"title":"","content":"The really abusive ones are things like granting someone all sorts of assets in a soul pact \u2014 assets that you arguable get to keep when you collect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}